      "message": "This doesn\u0027t seem like an improvement, it is spreading the special casing of isCrt around even more.  It also doesn\u0027t fix any other callers of ctx.minSdkVersion that may be using it with similar expectations.  Would it work to do it somewhere inside ctx.minSdkVersion?",
